# First-pass Orange Pi 5B slim profile.
# Keep: RK3588S boot/storage, onboard LAN, USB, HDMI/DRM Rockchip,
# Panthor Mali GPU, Rockchip media codecs/RGA, Broadcom Wi-Fi family.

